        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.2(e) The Company will seek candidates from within the existing workforce for all positions that are designated by the Company as open positions. Employees on the active payroll who have been declared surplus and/or who have been previously downgraded shall have priority rights to open positions as described in 8.2(e)(1) and 8.2(e)(2), respectively. For open positions remaining after the provisions of 8.2(e)(1) and 8.2(e)(2) have been met, other candidates shall receive consideration as described in 8.2(e)(3).",
